{"seq":2,"slug":"auto-replenish-trigger","title":"自动补货触发与协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-procurement-collaboration/collab-replenish/auto-replenish-trigger","wordCount":3196,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动补货触发与协同\">自动补货触发与协同</h1><p>补货的计算结果出来了：某个 SKU 下个月需要 12000 件，分配给供应商 A 8000 件、供应商 B 4000 件。这条结论看起来已经可以变成采购订单了，但如果它直接变成订单，几乎必然出事——供应商 A 的产线这个月排满了接不下 8000、供应商 B 的最小起订量是 5000 而不是 4000、品类规则要求两家之间的份额不能超过 7:3、以及这批货的发货主体不在该市场的授权范围内。补货计算只知道需求与库存，它不知道上游的现实约束。所以<strong>补货建议不能直接变订单，必须先成为一张双方可编辑的协同单</strong>。</p>\n<p>本文讨论的正是这个中间形态：补货建议如何生成、如何被上游约束反向修正、以及如何收敛成一份双方认可的采购需求。它不讨论预测算法本身（属于 <code>46_demand-forecast-replenishment</code>）、不讨论协同模式如何选择（那是<a href=\"forecast-sharing-vmi\">预测共享与 VMI 供应商管库存</a>的题目）、也不讨论订单确认后的状态流转（那是<a href=\"../purchase-collab/po-collab-flow\">采购订单协同确认与变更</a>的题目）。自动补货的产出是一份采购订单草稿，它进入第 2 章的状态机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-补货建议是一个受约束的优化问题\">核心概念：补货建议是一个受约束的优化问题</h2><p>先明确补货建议要解的数学问题。朴素的做法是「库存低于再订货点就补到目标水位」，这个规则的问题在于它只看单个 SKU 的当前状态，看不到上游的共享约束。再订货点本身有标准定义：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROP = E(L)\\cdot E(D) + SS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为平均交期、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E(D)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 为单位时间平均需求、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 为安全库存（来源：Safety stock, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safety_stock）。真实的补货是在一组约束下优化一个目标的组合问题。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Safety_stock）。真实的补货是在一组约束下优化一个目标的组合问题。</a></p>\n<p>目标可以写成总成本最小化：采购成本、持有成本、缺货惩罚、以及运输与操作成本之和。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∗</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum*{i,t} \\Big( c_i \\cdot q*{i,t} + h*i \\cdot I*{i,t}^{+} + b*i \\cdot I*{i,t}^{-} + T*i(q*{i,t}) \\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6597em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0158em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0158em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{i,t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 SKU <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在时段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的补货量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^{+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是期末正库存、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>I</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I^{-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是期末缺货量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c/h/b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 分别是单位采购、持有、缺货成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是运输与操作的分段成本（这里有包装倍数与整车满载的阶梯）。约束则来自上游与规则两侧。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束类别</th>\n<th>具体形式</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>违反的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最小起订量 MOQ</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mtext>MOQ</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i \\ge \\text{MOQ}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MOQ</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>供应商档案</td>\n<td>供应商拒单或加收小单费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包装倍数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>pack</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_i \\bmod \\text{pack}_i = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pack</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>供应商档案</td>\n<td>实发量被迫偏离建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产能上限</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i q_{i,t} \\le \\text{cap}_{v,t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8108em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>档案 + 协商</td>\n<td>供应商无法承诺，交期推迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权范围</td>\n<td>供应商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 在该市场该品类有有效授权</td>\n<td>授权矩阵</td>\n<td>订单被门禁拦下</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>份额规则</td>\n<td>单供应商份额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\le</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span></span></span></span></span> 上限比例</td>\n<td>品类策略</td>\n<td>采购集中度风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交期与到货窗</td>\n<td>到货时间落在可收货窗口内</td>\n<td>仓容与作业排班</td>\n<td>月台拥堵、拒收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金与账期</td>\n<td>采购额落在预算与账期内</td>\n<td>财务规则</td>\n<td>付款异常、审批受阻</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的意义在于它是<strong>补货建议与采购订单之间的校验清单</strong>。补货引擎生成的原始建议必须过一遍这些约束；不满足的部分不是被丢弃，而是被<strong>修正或标记</strong>——修正（如向上取整到包装倍数）能自动完成，而无法自动完成的（如产能不足）必须形成一条待协商项交给协同流程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[需求预测&lt;br/&gt;来自 46] --&gt; B[库存与在途快照&lt;br/&gt;在库/在途/在制/已分配]&#10;    B --&gt; C[净需求计算&lt;br/&gt;需求 - 可用 - 在途 + 安全库存]&#10;    C --&gt; D{授权门禁&lt;br/&gt;见 1.3}&#10;    D --&gt;|无授权| E[剔除该供应商&lt;br/&gt;换备选或人工]&#10;    D --&gt;|有授权| F[原始补货建议]&#10;    F --&gt; G[约束修正&lt;br/&gt;MOQ/倍数/产能/份额]&#10;    G --&gt; H{是否存在无法满足项}&#10;    H --&gt;|否| I[生成协同单草稿]&#10;    H --&gt;|是| J[标记待协商项]&#10;    J --&gt; K[推送给供应商协商]&#10;    K --&gt; L[供应商回应&lt;br/&gt;接受/减量/改期/拒绝]&#10;    L --&gt; M[平台调整建议]&#10;    M --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; N[平台内部审批]&#10;    N --&gt; O[转为采购订单草稿&lt;br/&gt;进入 2.1 状态机]\">graph TD\n    A[需求预测&lt;br/&gt;来自 46] --&gt; B[库存与在途快照&lt;br/&gt;在库/在途/在制/已分配]\n    B --&gt; C[净需求计算&lt;br/&gt;需求 - 可用 - 在途 + 安全库存]\n    C --&gt; D{授权门禁&lt;br/&gt;见 1.3}\n    D --&gt;|无授权| E[剔除该供应商&lt;br/&gt;换备选或人工]\n    D --&gt;|有授权| F[原始补货建议]\n    F --&gt; G[约束修正&lt;br/&gt;MOQ/倍数/产能/份额]\n    G --&gt; H{是否存在无法满足项}\n    H --&gt;|否| I[生成协同单草稿]\n    H --&gt;|是| J[标记待协商项]\n    J --&gt; K[推送给供应商协商]\n    K --&gt; L[供应商回应&lt;br/&gt;接受/减量/改期/拒绝]\n    L --&gt; M[平台调整建议]\n    M --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; N[平台内部审批]\n    N --&gt; O[转为采购订单草稿&lt;br/&gt;进入 2.1 状态机]</pre><p>这张图里有三个关键设计决定。</p>\n<p><strong>净需求的计算必须全面。</strong> 净需求不是「预测需求减当前库存」，还要减去在途（已确认但未到货的采购订单）、在制（供应商已投产但未发运的部分）、以及已分配未发（已经被下游订单占用但仍显示在库的部分）。漏掉任何一项都会导致重复补货。跨境场景下还要考虑在途的到货时间与需求的时间分布是否匹配——一批明天到的货能满足下周需求，但满足不了今天的需求，所以净需求要按时间桶计算，而不能只算总量。这是本 hub 与 <code>34_global-inventory-sync-platform</code> 的接口：库存同步系统提供各状态的数量与预计到达时间，本 hub 计算净需求。</p>\n<p><strong>协同单必须是一等公民。</strong> 协同单（采购需求确认单）是补货建议与采购订单之间的独立实体，它有自己的编号、状态、版本、参与者与有效期。它存在的理由有三：一是它承载<strong>协商过程</strong>（供应商的减量、改期请求与平台的调整都在这里发生，而不是在原建议上反复覆盖）；二是它跨多个采购订单（一次协同可能最终落成多张订单或多批发运）；三是它记录<strong>约束的来源</strong>（这条建议受哪个产能约束、哪条份额规则影响），让后续复盘能回答「为什么这个月补得少」。把它省掉、让建议直接变订单的做法在实践中都会退回到邮件协商，因为约束冲突是常态而非例外。</p>\n<p><strong>无法满足项必须显式协商而不是静默降级。</strong> 当产能不足时，系统有三种可能的行为：静默把数量降到产能上限（危险：平台不知道缺口存在，缺货会突然发生）、静默丢弃该供应商并转给备选（危险：份额规则与关系被无意改变）、或生成待协商项推给供应商（正确）。选择第三种不是流程上的洁癖，而是因为它把「缺口」变成了一个<strong>被双方知晓的、有责任主体的对象</strong>。缺口是有责任的：如果供应商无法按承诺产能供货，第 4 章的绩效评分卡要记录这一点；如果是平台的需求突然增加超出预期，责任在平台，可能需要商务让步（加价、加急运费补贴）。静默降级会让这两种情况在数据里变得无法区分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上游约束的反向修正\">上游约束的反向修正</h2><p>补货算法默认供应商是被动的，这在大多数场景下是错的。真实的修正来自上游，且修正的强度与协同模式直接相关。</p>\n<p><strong>在信息共享模式下</strong>，供应商对补货建议没有决策权，但它的约束会通过档案里的产能、MOQ、交期参数提前进入计算。修正发生在「约束校验」阶段，供应商在订单下发后才可能提出异议。</p>\n<p><strong>在 VMI 模式下</strong>，供应商自己决定补货量，平台的补货建议退化为<strong>参考</strong>。此时平台能施加的约束只剩水位上下限与授权校验（见<a href=\"forecast-sharing-vmi\">预测共享与 VMI 供应商管库存</a>）。理解这个区别很重要：同一个「自动补货」功能在两种模式下的实现几乎不同——前者输出订单草稿，后者输出建议与水位告警。</p>\n<p><strong>在 CPFR 协商模式下</strong>，修正发生在协商过程中，双方的排产计划与促销计划被放在一起看。这一层最有价值的输出不是数字而是<strong>日历对齐</strong>：平台的促销周与供应商的产线检修周如果撞在一起，双方必须在计划阶段就发现，而不是在大促前一周才被告知供不上——这正是 CPFR 九阶段模型中「识别并共同解决预测例外项」两个阶段所要保证的（来源：CPFR, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collaborative_planning,_forecasting,_and_replenishment）。系统上这意味着协同单需要携带时间窗（不仅仅是总量），并能把双方的时间约束可视化地叠在一起。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collaborative_planning,_forecasting,_and_replenishment）。系统上这意味着协同单需要携带时间窗（不仅仅是总量），并能把双方的时间约束可视化地叠在一起。</a></p>\n<p>一个普遍适用的修正原则：<strong>产能约束的粒度是「供应商 × 时间桶」，而不是「供应商」</strong>。一个供应商月产能 50 万件，不代表它在春节前后两周能有产能。补货引擎必须在时间桶粒度上校验产能，并且要接受供应商对时间桶的协商（「这个月给不了 20 万，但下个月可以给 30 万」）。如果产能只有一个总量字段，所有的时间分布问题都会被静默压平，最终表现为「订单都能下、货总是晚到」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"补货节奏与触发方式\">补货节奏与触发方式</h2><p>补货什么时候跑，比补货算什么更容易被忽视。三种触发方式各有明确的适用场景，混用会导致系统行为难以解释。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发方式</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定期批量</td>\n<td>固定周期（每日/每周）</td>\n<td>结果稳定、便于批量协商</td>\n<td>响应慢、对突发需求不敏感</td>\n<td>稳定品类、长交期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n<td>库存低于阈值、订单激增、促销确认</td>\n<td>响应快</td>\n<td>易产生抖动与重复建议</td>\n<td>短交期、快消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>定期为主 + 关键事件补跑</td>\n<td>平衡</td>\n<td>需处理两次建议的一致性</td>\n<td>多数生产环境的实际选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>混合模式的关键技术问题是<strong>两次运行的建议如何合并</strong>。定期运行生成了建议 R1（已推送供应商协商中），随后一次事件驱动运行生成了建议 R2（同一个 SKU、同一个供应商）——是把 R2 作为 R1 的修订版本，还是并列为两条建议？正确答案是<strong>同一时间窗内同一供应商的补货建议必须唯一</strong>，后来的运行只能修改它而不能新建。实现上需要一个唯一性键（供应商 × 目的仓 × 时间窗），以及一套「新建议与在途协商如何叠加」的规则：如果 R1 已经进入协商，R2 的增量应当作为 R1 的追加项，让供应商看到的是「原来 8000 件，现在需要 9500 件」，而不是两条各说各话的建议。</p>\n<p>另一个必须定义的参数是<strong>冻结窗口</strong>。在到货日之前的某段时间内（依据交期与供应商排产周期）不再允许修改补货建议，因为供应商已经投产或备料，改动的成本极高。冻结窗口的长度应当由档案里的交期决定，并可以在供应商维度单独配置（灵活度高的供应商可以更晚冻结）。缺少冻结窗口的系统会产生「每周都在改订单」的现象，而供应商的应对方式是把排产留出大量缓冲，最终让交期人为变长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>补货建议不能直接变订单，因为<strong>补货计算只知道需求与库存，不知道上游约束</strong>；两者之间必须有协同单这一等公民。</li>\n<li>补货是在约束下优化总成本的组合问题：目标是采购、持有、缺货、运输操作成本之和，约束来自 MOQ、包装倍数、产能、授权、份额规则、到货窗、资金账期。</li>\n<li><strong>净需求必须全面</strong>：减去在库、在途、在制、已分配未发，并按时间桶计算以匹配到货时间与需求分布；这是与 <code>34_global-inventory-sync-platform</code> 的接口。</li>\n<li>无法满足的约束必须<strong>显式协商而非静默降级</strong>；静默降级会让「供应商供不上」与「平台需求超预期」在数据里无法区分，从而使责任无法归属。</li>\n<li>上游约束的反向修正强度取决于协同模式：信息共享靠档案参数提前进入计算，CPFR 靠日历对齐，VMI 下建议退化为参考、平台只剩水位与授权约束。</li>\n<li>**产能约束的粒度是「供应商 × 时间桶」**而非供应商总量；总量字段会把时间分布问题静默压平，表现为「订单能下、货总是晚到」。</li>\n<li>触发方式选混合模式（定期为主 + 事件补跑），并保证<strong>同一时间窗同一供应商的补货建议唯一</strong>，事件运行只能修订不能新建；同时定义<strong>冻结窗口</strong>，避免持续改单把交期的缓冲成本转回平台。</li>\n<li>补货建议的最终形态是采购订单草稿，进入<a href=\"../purchase-collab/po-collab-flow\">采购订单协同确认与变更</a>的状态机；授权的校验位置见<a href=\"../supplier-onboarding/supplier-category-scope\">供应商-品类授权范围</a>；产能与 MOQ 的数据来源见<a href=\"../supplier-onboarding/supplier-profile-data\">供应商档案与供货能力</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动补货触发与协同","id":"自动补货触发与协同"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：补货建议是一个受约束的优化问题","id":"核心概念-补货建议是一个受约束的优化问题"},{"level":2,"text":"上游约束的反向修正","id":"上游约束的反向修正"},{"level":2,"text":"补货节奏与触发方式","id":"补货节奏与触发方式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预测共享与 VMI 供应商管库存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-procurement-collaboration/collab-replenish/forecast-sharing-vmi"},"next":{"title":"新品引入与供货协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-procurement-collaboration/collab-replenish/new-product-supply"}}